# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "Check the tunnel service and firewall on the relay server and make sure port 443 (and port 80 for SSL) are forwarded to this server."
msgstr "请检查中转服务器上的隧道服务和防火墙，确保端口 443（以及 SSL 所需的端口 80）已转发到此服务器。"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "Nothing answered TLS on port 443"
msgstr "443 端口上没有任何 TLS 响应"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "Port 443 on the relay server answers with a different certificate than the one on this server. If you recently moved the panel to a new server, the tunnel on the relay server is still pointing to the old server IP, or the relay server is terminating TLS itself."
msgstr "中转服务器的 443 端口使用了与此服务器不同的证书响应。如果面板最近迁移到新服务器，可能是中转服务器上的隧道仍指向旧 IP，或中转服务器自行终结了 TLS。"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "Port 443 on the relay server forwards traffic to this server as expected."
msgstr "中转服务器的 443 端口按预期将流量转发到此服务器。"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "Port 443 on the relay server is not responding"
msgstr "中转服务器的 443 端口无响应"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "Port 443 on the relay server is not responding, and port 80 is not forwarded to this server either. Fix the tunnel on the relay server so ports 443 and 80 reach this server, then ask again."
msgstr "中转服务器的 443 端口无响应，端口 80 也未转发到此服务器。请修复中转服务器上的隧道，使 443 和 80 端口能到达此服务器，然后再申请。"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "Port 443 on the relay server reaches this server, but validation over port 443 did not succeed and port 80 is not forwarded from the relay server to this server. Forward TCP port 80 from the relay server to this server as well, then ask again."
msgstr "中转服务器的 443 端口能到达此服务器，但通过 443 的验证未成功，且 80 端口未从中转服务器转发。请将中转服务器的 TCP 80 端口也转发到此服务器，然后再申请。"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "The SSL certificate expires soon"
msgstr "SSL 证书即将过期"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "The SSL certificate has expired"
msgstr "SSL 证书已过期"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "The SSL certificate is not trusted"
msgstr "SSL 证书不受信任"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "The SSL certificate is self-signed"
msgstr "SSL 证书为自签名"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "The relay server is answering on port 443 with another server’s certificate (not forwarding traffic to this server). If you moved the panel to a new server, update the tunnel target IP on the relay server to this server’s IP and forward ports 80 and 443, then ask again."
msgstr "中转服务器在 443 端口上使用另一个服务器的证书响应（未将流量转发到此服务器）。如果面板已迁移到新服务器，请将中转服务器上隧道的目标 IP 更新为此服务器的 IP，并转发 80 和 443 端口，然后再申请。"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "The relay tunnel does not point to this server"
msgstr "中转隧道未指向此服务器"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "This domain is set to Relay mode, but its DNS record points to this server itself instead of the relay server."
msgstr "此域名设置为 Relay 模式，但其 DNS 记录指向此服务器本身而不是中转服务器。"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "This server could not complete a TLS handshake with the relay server on port 443, so the tunnel is down or port 443 is closed on the relay."
msgstr "此服务器无法与中转服务器在 443 端口完成 TLS 握手——隧道已断开或中转服务器的 443 端口被关闭。"

# watashi v12.3.47b: relay tunnel and ssl diagnostics
msgid "Update the tunnel destination IP on the relay server to point to this server, then check again."
msgstr "请更新中转服务器上隧道的目标 IP，使其指向此服务器，然后再次检查。"

