msgstr "在浏览器中打开"

msgid "Press the button on the device where you use Telegram. The bot links that chat to your admin account, and only then can it answer you."
msgstr "请在您使用 Telegram 的设备上点击按钮。机器人会将该聊天与您的管理员账户绑定，之后才能回复您。"

msgid "Telegram is told to deliver every message to @DOMAIN@. If the bot stays silent on this server, run watashi-panel-cli tgbot-doctor."
msgstr "Telegram 已被指示将所有消息发送到 @DOMAIN@。如果机器人在此服务器上没有反应，请运行 watashi-panel-cli tgbot-doctor。"

msgid "The start link was copied."
msgstr "启动链接已复制。"

msgid "The start link could not be copied."
msgstr "启动链接复制失败。"

msgid "Network card traffic since boot"
msgstr "开机以来的网卡流量"

msgid "Received"
msgstr "接收"

msgid "Sent"
msgstr "发送"

msgid "This is what the network card itself counted. Every byte a user spends passes it twice, once coming in and once going out, and the server's own updates and backups are counted here too. It being around twice the users' total is normal, not a mistake."
msgstr "这是网卡本身统计的数据。用户的每个字节都会经过它两次（一次进、一次出），服务器自身的更新和备份也计入其中。数值约为用户总流量的两倍是正常现象，并非错误。"

msgid "testing now"
msgstr "正在测试"

msgid "the other core answered this one"
msgstr "此配置由另一个内核响应"

msgid "The job keeps running on the server. This page picks up again by itself the moment the panel answers, there is no need to refresh it."
msgstr "任务会在服务器上继续运行。面板恢复响应后此页面会自动恢复，无需刷新。"

msgid "The job ended with an error (code {code})."
msgstr "任务以错误结束（代码 {code}）。"

msgid "The update is running on the server. The panel goes away for a few minutes in the middle of it; this page keeps following the log and says when it is over."
msgstr "更新正在服务器上运行。期间面板会短暂消失；此页面会持续跟随日志并在结束时告知。"

msgid "A certificate was issued but could not be put in place. The log below says why."
msgstr "证书已签发，但无法安装。下方日志说明了原因。"

msgid "A domain longer than 64 characters cannot get a certificate."
msgstr "超过 64 个字符的域名无法获取证书。"

msgid "A new certificate is asked for this domain right now, even if the current one still looks valid. Use it after moving to a new server, restoring a backup or fixing the DNS record."
msgstr "正在为此域名重新申请证书，即使当前证书仍然有效。适用于迁移到新服务器、恢复备份或修复 DNS 记录之后。"

msgid "Another certificate request for this domain was still running. Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "此域名的另一个证书申请仍在进行中。请几分钟后重试。"

msgid "Ask again"
msgstr "再次申请"

msgid "Ask for a new SSL certificate for this domain now"
msgstr "立即为此域名申请新的 SSL 证书"

msgid "Asking the certificate authority..."
msgstr "正在向证书颁发机构申请…"

msgid "Every request counts against the limits of the authority (Let's Encrypt allows five for the same domain in a week), so do not repeat it without a reason."
msgstr "每次申请都会消耗颁发机构的限额（Let's Encrypt 一个域名一周最多五次），请勿无谓重复。"

msgid "Get SSL"
msgstr "获取 SSL"

msgid "Get a new certificate"
msgstr "获取新证书"

msgid "Getting SSL..."
msgstr "正在获取 SSL…"

msgid "New SSL certificate"
msgstr "新的 SSL 证书"

msgid "No authority issued a certificate. The domain keeps its previous certificate, or a self-signed one. The log below says why."
msgstr "没有任何颁发机构签发证书。域名会保留原来的证书或自签名证书。下方日志说明了原因。"

msgid "Not trusted"
msgstr "不受信任"

msgid "Self-signed"
msgstr "自签名"

msgid "The certificate request could not be started."
msgstr "无法开始证书申请。"

msgid "The certificate was read from this server itself."
msgstr "证书是从本服务器本地读取的。"

msgid "The current certificate is still good, so nothing was asked."
msgstr "当前证书仍然有效，因此未申请新证书。"

msgid "The last attempt failed a short while ago, so nothing was asked this time."
msgstr "上次尝试刚失败不久，因此这次未再申请。"

msgid "The last check says this domain does not point at this server. The request fails until the DNS record is fixed."
msgstr "上次检查显示此域名未指向此服务器。在 DNS 记录修复之前申请都会失败。"

msgid "The last request stopped before it finished."
msgstr "上次请求中途停止。"

msgid "The last request:"
msgstr "上次请求："

msgid "The new certificate is in place."
msgstr "新证书已就位。"

msgid "The new certificate is in place. It lasts @N@ days."
msgstr "新证书已就位。有效期 @N@ 天。"

msgid "The request ended without saying how. The log below may tell."
msgstr "请求结束但未说明原因。下方日志可能提供线索。"

msgid "This can take a few minutes. You can close this window, the request goes on."
msgstr "这可能需要几分钟。可以关闭此窗口，申请会继续进行。"

msgid "This certificate is self-signed, so the clients refuse it."
msgstr "此证书为自签名，客户端会拒绝它。"

msgid "This domain does not point at this server, so no authority could check it. Point it at this server, wait a few minutes, then ask again."
msgstr "此域名未指向此服务器，因此没有颁发机构能验证它。请将域名指向此服务器，等待几分钟后再申请。"

msgid "This domain has no DNS record, so no authority could check it."
msgstr "此域名没有 DNS 记录，因此没有颁发机构能验证它。"

msgid "This is not a name an authority issues certificates for."
msgstr "这不是证书颁发机构为其签发证书的名称。"

msgid "This name is served by another server or a CDN, so no certificate was asked for."
msgstr "此名称由其他服务器或 CDN 提供，因此未申请证书。"

msgid "This server does not ask an authority for the certificate of this domain."
msgstr "此服务器不会为此域名的证书申请颁发机构。"

msgid "This server holds only a self-signed certificate for this domain, and the clients refuse it."
msgstr "此服务器上此域名只有自签名证书，客户端会拒绝它。"

msgid "config.advanced_mode.label"
msgstr "高级模式"

msgid "config.advanced_mode.description"
msgstr "打开 Inbounds 页面和专家设置。"

msgid "config.custom_inbounds_keep.label"
msgstr "在简单模式下保留手动创建的 inbounds"

msgid "config.custom_inbounds_keep.description"
msgstr "开启后，高级模式下创建的 inbounds 会在简单模式下继续服务。关闭则暂停它们。"


# --- API book: matrix and subscription additions ---

msgid "Parent API"
msgstr "父面板 API"

msgid "The half of the matrix mode the parent panel answers. A row for the panel key is called with the key of the child, which the parent knows once the child registers."
msgstr "矩阵模式中由父面板应答的一半。标为“面板密钥”的行使用子面板的密钥调用；子面板注册后父面板就会记住该密钥。"

msgid "Child API"
msgstr "子面板 API"

msgid "The half of the matrix mode the child panel answers. A row for the panel key is called with the key of the parent, which the child holds once it registers."
msgstr "矩阵模式中由子面板应答的一半。标为“面板密钥”的行使用父面板的密钥调用；子面板注册后即持有该密钥。"

msgid "Panel key"
msgstr "面板密钥"

msgid "Reads the app asking and answers in the format that app understands. A browser gets the customer page, an app its config. The one link to hand out."
msgstr "读取请求的应用并以它理解的格式应答。浏览器得到客户页面，应用得到自己的配置。就是要交给用户的那个链接。"

msgid "The customer page"
msgstr "客户页面"

msgid "The page a customer opens in a browser to pick an app and copy their links."
msgstr "客户在浏览器中打开的页面，用于选择应用并复制自己的链接。"

msgid "Text links"
msgstr "文本链接"

msgid "The same links without base64, one per line."
msgstr "相同的链接，不带 base64，每行一个。"

msgid "Xray json"
msgstr "Xray JSON"

msgid "The whole profile as the json an Xray client imports."
msgstr "整个配置文件，格式为 Xray 客户端可导入的 JSON。"

msgid "Only the proxies"
msgstr "仅代理"

msgid "Just the proxies block, for a profile of their own. clash/meta/proxies.yml for Mihomo."
msgstr "仅 YAML 的 proxies 部分，适合自己维护配置文件的用户。Mihomo 用 clash/meta/proxies.yml。"

msgid "The whole profile as sing-box json. singbox/ is the same file under a shorter name."
msgstr "整个配置文件的 sing-box JSON。singbox/ 是同一文件的简短地址。"

msgid "Sing-Box with ssh"
msgstr "Sing-Box（含 SSH）"

msgid "The sing-box json with the ssh tunnels of the account added. Answers that the ssh server is disabled when it is off."
msgstr "在 sing-box JSON 中加入该账号的 SSH 隧道。若 SSH 服务器已关闭，会返回相应提示。"

msgid "Echo the user agent"
msgstr "回显 User-Agent"

msgid "Debug: answers with the user agent the panel saw. Handy to check what an app sends."
msgstr "调试：返回面板看到的 User-Agent。方便检查应用发送的内容。"

msgid "Does this child exist"
msgstr "该子面板是否存在"

msgid "A child asks with its unique id before it registers; the answer is whether the parent already holds such a child."
msgstr "子面板在注册前用自己的唯一 ID 询问；回答是父面板是否已存在该子面板。"

msgid "Register a child"
msgstr "注册子面板"

msgid "The child hands over its whole panel: admins, customers, domains, configs and proxies. The parent answers with its own customers and admins, so both sides start even."
msgstr "子面板交出其整个面板：管理员、客户、域名、配置和代理。父面板返回自己的客户和管理员，使双方数据对齐。"

msgid "Sync a child"
msgstr "同步子面板"

msgid "The child pushes the domains, configs and proxies it holds; the parent answers with the full list of customers and admins. At least one of the three lists is required."
msgstr "子面板推送其域名、配置和代理；父面板返回完整的客户和管理员列表。三个列表至少需要一个。"

msgid "Push the usage"
msgstr "推送用量"

msgid "The child reports what every customer has spent; the parent adds only the increase and answers with the usage it now holds."
msgstr "子面板上报每个客户的消耗；父面板只累加增量并返回其当前记录的用量。"

msgid "Register with a parent"
msgstr "向父面板注册"

msgid "Makes this panel a child of a parent. parent_panel is the address of the parent, apikey the key of an owner there. The panel must be standalone or a child already."
msgstr "将本面板设为某父面板的子面板。parent_panel 是父面板地址，apikey 是其所有者的密钥。面板须为独立模式或已是子面板。"

msgid "Sync now"
msgstr "立即同步"

msgid "Pulls everything the parent holds and rewrites the local data with it. The parent may call it, and so may an owner of this panel."
msgstr "拉取父面板的全部数据并重写本地数据。父面板可以调用，本面板的所有者也可以。"

msgid "Runs the status command on this panel and answers ok. The parent calls it to see whether the child is alive."
msgstr "在本面板上运行 status 命令并返回 ok。父面板调用它以确认子面板存活。"

msgid "Restarts the services of this panel."
msgstr "重启本面板的服务。"

msgid "Apply the config"
msgstr "应用配置"

msgid "Rebuilds the running config from the database, without a full install."
msgstr "从数据库重建运行中的配置，无需完整安装。"

msgid "Runs the installer again. With full set, it installs everything from the start."
msgstr "再次运行安装程序。设为 full 时从头安装全部内容。"

msgid "Refresh the usage"
msgstr "刷新用量"

msgid "Reads the usage off the cores of this panel right now."
msgstr "立即从本面板的内核读取用量。"

msgid "Auto"
msgstr "自动"

msgid "Device Limit Enforced"
msgstr "已启用设备限制"

msgid "No Device Limit"
msgstr "无设备限制"

msgid "App Distribution"
msgstr "应用分布"

msgid "Operator Distribution"
msgstr "运营商分布"

msgid "Unknown app"
msgstr "未知应用"

msgid "Unknown operator"
msgstr "未知运营商"

msgid "Turn on the device limit"
msgstr "开启设备限制"

msgid "This page tracks every device on its own, even with the device limit off. The parts below only work while the limit is on: blocking extra devices, the \"device not supported\" lockout and the over-limit marks."
msgstr "本页面独立追踪每台设备，即使关闭设备限制也能正常工作。仅在开启限制时生效的功能：拦截超额设备、「应用程序不受支持」锁定以及超限标记。"

msgid "Last online"
msgstr "最后在线"

msgid "Last seen"
msgstr "最后出现"

msgid "Outbounds"
msgstr "出站"

msgid "New Outbound"
msgstr "新建出站"

msgid "Edit Outbound"
msgstr "编辑出站"

msgid "Delete this outbound?"
msgstr "删除此出站？"

msgid "The core accepts this outbound"
msgstr "核心接受此出站"

msgid "Outbound not found"
msgstr "未找到出站"

msgid "outbound.address.required"
msgstr "需要服务器地址"

msgid "outbound.port.range"
msgstr "端口须在 1 至 65535 之间"

msgid "outbound.tag.required"
msgstr "需要标签 (tag)"

msgid "outbound.tag.taken"
msgstr "该标签已被占用"

msgid "outbound.tag.reserved"
msgstr "该标签为保留标签"

msgid "outbound.protocol.xray_only"
msgstr "xray 内核不支持此协议（仅 sing-box）"

msgid "outbound.network.bad"
msgstr "传输层无效"

msgid "outbound.security.bad"
msgstr "安全层无效"

msgid "xray does not accept this outbound:"
msgstr "xray 不接受此出站:"

msgid "sing-box does not accept this outbound:"
msgstr "sing-box 不接受此出站:"

msgid "Total usage"
msgstr "总用量"

msgid "Connected devices"
msgstr "已连接设备"

msgid "Allow insecure TLS"
msgstr "允许不安全 TLS"

msgid "Deleted"
msgstr "已删除"

msgid "Encryption method"
msgstr "加密方法"

msgid "Remark"
msgstr "备注"

msgid "Tag"
msgstr "标签"

msgid "The hand built outbounds of the advanced mode. An outbound sends nothing by itself; the traffic reaches it through the routing rules."
msgstr "高级模式的手动出站。出站本身不发送任何流量；流量通过路由规则到达它。"

msgid "Routing"
msgstr "路由"

msgid "New Rule"
msgstr "新建规则"

msgid "Edit Rule"
msgstr "编辑规则"

msgid "Delete this rule?"
msgstr "删除此规则？"

msgid "Rule not found"
msgstr "未找到规则"

msgid "Match"
msgstr "匹配"

msgid "Target"
msgstr "目标"

msgid "Ports"
msgstr "端口"

msgid "Inbound tags"
msgstr "入站标签"

msgid "Everything"
msgstr "全部"

msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

msgid "rule.target.required"
msgstr "需要目标"

msgid "rule.core.bad"
msgstr "核心无效"

msgid "rule.network.bad"
msgstr "网络无效"

msgid "rule.protocol.bad"
msgstr "协议无效"

msgid "rule.protocol.xray_only"
msgstr "此协议仅 xray 支持"

msgid "rule.ports.bad"
msgstr "端口格式应为 443 或 8000-9000"

msgid "rule.domain.bad"
msgstr "某个域名格式不正确"

msgid "rule.ip.bad"
msgstr "某个 IP 格式不正确"

msgid "rule.match.required"
msgstr "至少需要一个匹配条件"

msgid "The hand built routing rules of the advanced mode. The rules run top down: the first rule that matches a connection sends it to its target and the rest are skipped."
msgstr "高级模式的手动路由规则。规则自上而下执行：第一条匹配连接的规则将流量发送到其目标，其余规则被跳过。"

msgid "Connect"
msgstr "连接"

msgid "Failed"
msgstr "失败"

msgid "Live connect test"
msgstr "实时连接测试"

msgid "Fallbacks"
msgstr "备用"

msgid "Fallbacks placeholder"
msgstr "tag1, tag2 — 失败时按顺序尝试"

msgid "The outbound did not answer"
msgstr "出站无响应"

msgid "Unknown outbound tags: "
msgstr "未知标签："

msgid "The core refused this outbound"
msgstr "核心拒绝此出站"

msgid "Build it field by field, the way x-ui and Marzban do it. Saving applies only this core once, for about a second."
msgstr "像 x-ui 和 Marzban 一样逐字段构建。保存只会重启这一个核心，约一秒钟。"

msgid "Test it with the real core before saving"
msgstr "保存前用真实核心试一试"

msgid "The exit a routing rule hands its traffic to. The outbound sends nothing by itself; a rule reaches it by tag."
msgstr "路由规则把流量交给的那个出口。出站本身不发送任何东西；规则通过标签找到它。"

msgid "The live test asks the exit for its real IP and country"
msgstr "实时测试会向出口询问其真实 IP 和国家"

msgid "A hand built rule decides which connection takes which exit. The cores match from the top down, so order matters."
msgstr "手动创建的规则决定哪个连接走哪个出口。核心自上而下匹配，因此顺序很重要。"

msgid "First match wins — keep the narrow rules on top"
msgstr "首个匹配生效 — 把更严格的规则放在上面"
msgid "Configs this domain delivers"
msgstr "此域名提供的配置"

msgid "Switch a config off to stop this domain from delivering it. The config keeps running on the server."
msgstr "关闭某个配置后，此域名将不再提供它。配置仍会在服务器上运行。"

msgid "Turn every config on or off"
msgstr "开启或关闭所有配置"

msgid "No configs are enabled in the panel."
msgstr "面板中没有已启用的配置。"

msgid "Save failed"
msgstr "保存失败"

msgid "ACTIVE"
msgstr "个启用"
